# Logs, secrets, and private evidence
*.log
*.pid
*.lock
.env
.env.*
*.pem
*.key
*token*
reports/**/private/
reports/**/screenshots/
reports/**/*private*

# Generated reports are private by default. The checked-in README remains a
# placeholder; copy in only deliberately redacted summaries after review.
reports/**/*.json
reports/**/*.txt
!reports/**/README.md

# Redacted, machine-readable acceptance summaries and README files may be
# committed deliberately. Review them for credentials, hostnames, signed URLs,
# and private image paths before adding them.
